cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "超星 AI 助教行为蒸馏：90 轮实测与学科无关注入提示词"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Laprom2049/chaoxing-agent-distillation"
abstract: >-
  Behavioral distillation of a course-site AI teaching assistant observed over
  90 authorized conversational turns. Delivers a subject-neutral injection
  prompt with six placeholders, a 14-case acceptance testkit, and an offline
  analysis pipeline that recomputes every reported metric from published
  derived data. Includes one falsified pre-registered hypothesis.
keywords:
  - agent behavior distillation
  - prompt engineering
  - educational AI
  - reproducibility
